# Booking CTA Video

The booking CTA section must use the showreel video located at
`vanilla/assets/video/reel.mp4` (served as `assets/video/reel.mp4`).

- Set `bookingCta.video.src` in `vanilla/js/data.js` to `assets/video/reel.mp4`.
- Do not point the CTA video at other files (e.g. `videoplayback.mp4`).
- Keep the reel under ~15 MB; compress replacements with ffmpeg/HandBrake before committing.
